{"seq":1,"slug":"engine-drivetrain","title":"引擎与传动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/vehicle-physics/dynamics/engine-drivetrain","wordCount":1207,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"引擎与传动\">引擎与传动</h1><p><a href=\"../wheels-tires/traction-slip\">牵引与打滑</a>讲了轮子转得比车快才有驱动力，但没说&quot;让轮子转起来的扭矩从哪来&quot;。答案是一条从引擎到车轮的传动链：燃烧产生的扭矩先经离合器、变速箱齿比放大或减小，再经差速器分配到左右驱动轮，最终化为接触面上的纵向滑移率。这条链路决定了一辆车的加速包络、换挡顿挫与转速红区——也是赛车游戏里&quot;声音对不对、节奏爽不爽&quot;的来源。本篇追踪扭矩这趟旅程，输出的轮上扭矩会经由<a href=\"../wheels-tires/traction-slip\">牵引与打滑</a>变成实际推力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>驱动力的旅程是一条扭矩传递链：引擎按转速产出扭矩，经齿比逐级变换，由差速器分到两侧车轮，转成车轮角加速度，最终通过滑移率落地为纵向力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    THROTTLE[油门] --&gt; ENGINE[引擎&lt;br/&gt;转速-扭矩曲线]&#10;    ENGINE --&gt; RPM[当前转速 RPM]&#10;    ENGINE --&gt; TQ[引擎扭矩]&#10;    TQ --&gt; CLUTCH[离合器&lt;br/&gt;换挡时断开]&#10;    CLUTCH --&gt; GEAR[变速箱&lt;br/&gt;齿比 i]&#10;    GEAR --&gt; FINAL[主减速比]&#10;    FINAL --&gt; DIFF[差速器&lt;br/&gt;左右分配]&#10;    DIFF --&gt; WHEEL[车轮扭矩]&#10;    WHEEL --&gt; WROT[车轮角加速度 ω̇]&#10;    WROT --&gt; SLIP[滑移率 κ]&#10;    SLIP --&gt; FX[纵向力 Fx]&#10;    WSPEED[车轮转速] -.反馈.-&gt; RPM\">flowchart TD\n    THROTTLE[油门] --&gt; ENGINE[引擎&lt;br/&gt;转速-扭矩曲线]\n    ENGINE --&gt; RPM[当前转速 RPM]\n    ENGINE --&gt; TQ[引擎扭矩]\n    TQ --&gt; CLUTCH[离合器&lt;br/&gt;换挡时断开]\n    CLUTCH --&gt; GEAR[变速箱&lt;br/&gt;齿比 i]\n    GEAR --&gt; FINAL[主减速比]\n    FINAL --&gt; DIFF[差速器&lt;br/&gt;左右分配]\n    DIFF --&gt; WHEEL[车轮扭矩]\n    WHEEL --&gt; WROT[车轮角加速度 ω̇]\n    WROT --&gt; SLIP[滑移率 κ]\n    SLIP --&gt; FX[纵向力 Fx]\n    WSPEED[车轮转速] -.反馈.-&gt; RPM</pre><p>下表对比三种驱动布局，它们决定哪些轮子出力，进而影响转向特性。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>驱动布局</th>\n<th>出力轮</th>\n<th>转向倾向</th>\n<th>典型车型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前驱 FWD</td>\n<td>前轮</td>\n<td>偏推头（欠转）</td>\n<td>家用车</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后驱 RWD</td>\n<td>后轮</td>\n<td>偏甩尾（过转）</td>\n<td>跑车/漂移车</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>四驱 AWD</td>\n<td>四轮</td>\n<td>较中性、抓地强</td>\n<td>拉力/性能车</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"引擎-转速-扭矩曲线\">引擎：转速—扭矩曲线</h2><p>引擎不是一个恒定的力源——它输出的扭矩随转速变化，画出来是一条中段隆起的曲线。低转扭矩不足（起步无力），中段达到扭矩峰值（最有劲），高转接近红区时扭矩回落（再轰油也无益，只会爆缸）。游戏里常用一张查找表或几段曲线拟合存这条 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>RPM</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{engine}(\\text{RPM})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RPM</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 关系，油门则作为这条曲线输出的乘子（0–1）。</p>\n<p>引擎转速并非自由变量，它由车轮转速经传动链反推：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RPM</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>ω</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RPM} = \\frac{\\omega_{wheel} \\cdot i_{gear} \\cdot i_{final} \\cdot 60}{2\\pi}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RPM</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0225em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3365em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ee</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ina</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>也就是说，挂哪个挡、车速多少，决定了引擎转在曲线的哪一段。这条反馈回路正是&quot;低挡高转有劲、高挡低转肉&quot;的来源，也是手动挡游戏里降挡补油的乐趣所在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"变速箱与差速器-扭矩的变换与分配\">变速箱与差速器：扭矩的变换与分配</h2><p>变速箱用一组齿比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i_{gear}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9456em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在&quot;扭矩&quot;和&quot;转速&quot;之间做权衡：低挡齿比大，把引擎扭矩放大（起步、爬坡有力）但限制极速；高挡齿比小，扭矩变小但允许更高车速。经齿比后，车轮扭矩近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{wheel} = T_{engine} \\cdot i_{gear} \\cdot i_{final} \\cdot \\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ee</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9456em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9456em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ina</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 是传动效率（约 0.9，损耗在齿轮摩擦）。换挡瞬间离合器断开、扭矩归零，这就是&quot;换挡顿挫&quot;——拟真游戏会真实模拟这段断扭，街机游戏往往直接抹平。</p>\n<p>差速器（differential）解决一个几何必然：过弯时外侧轮走的弧更长、转得更快，若左右轮硬连一根轴就会有一个被拖着打滑。开放式差速器允许两轮异速，但会把扭矩流向打滑的那个轮（单轮空转就没推力）；限滑差速器（LSD）则在两轮转速差大时锁一部分扭矩过去，是性能车与漂移车的关键部件。差速器的锁止特性如何影响出弯甩尾，与<a href=\"steering-stability\">转向与稳定性</a>紧密相关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"简化-多数游戏不模拟整条链\">简化：多数游戏不模拟整条链</h2><p>完整传动链对许多游戏是过度建模。大量街机与移动端赛车直接跳过引擎曲线、变速箱、差速器，用一条&quot;目标速度—加速度&quot;曲线或简单的力—速度查找表把油门映射成纵向力——玩家踩油门，车就按预设包络加速到极速，干净利落。这种简化在<a href=\"../practice/arcade-vs-sim\">街机与拟真取舍</a>里是核心决策：模拟到哪一层，取决于你的车要给谁开。</p>\n<p>即便简化，&quot;自动 vs 手动挡&quot;&quot;可见的换挡顿挫&quot;&quot;红区限速&quot;这些反馈元素仍常被部分保留，因为它们廉价却极大增强&quot;在开一台机器&quot;的代入感。如何取舍这些反馈，见<a href=\"../practice/vehicle-feel-tuning\">手感调校</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>驱动力是一条扭矩传递链：引擎曲线 → 离合 → 变速箱齿比 → 差速器 → 车轮扭矩 → 滑移率 → 纵向力。</li>\n<li>引擎扭矩随转速呈中段隆起曲线，转速由车轮速经齿比反推，形成&quot;低挡高转有劲&quot;的回路。</li>\n<li>齿比在扭矩与极速间权衡；差速器解决过弯左右轮异速，LSD 锁扭矩是性能/漂移关键。</li>\n<li>多数街机游戏用力—速度曲线跳过整条链，但常保留换挡反馈以增强代入感。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>扭矩如何落地：<a href=\"../wheels-tires/traction-slip\">牵引与打滑</a></li>\n<li>驱动布局影响转向：<a href=\"steering-stability\">转向与稳定性</a></li>\n<li>跨库（声音与扭矩的反馈）：<a href=\"../game-physics/rigid-body-dynamics/physics-engine-integration\">游戏物理 / 物理引擎集成</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"引擎与传动","id":"引擎与传动"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"引擎：转速—扭矩曲线","id":"引擎-转速-扭矩曲线"},{"level":2,"text":"变速箱与差速器：扭矩的变换与分配","id":"变速箱与差速器-扭矩的变换与分配"},{"level":2,"text":"简化：多数游戏不模拟整条链","id":"简化-多数游戏不模拟整条链"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"牵引与打滑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/vehicle-physics/wheels-tires/traction-slip"},"next":{"title":"转向与稳定性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/vehicle-physics/dynamics/steering-stability"}}